1
00:00:00,950 --> 00:00:03,180
(Raj:)and a teeny, tiny
Dark Knight.

2
00:00:04,920 --> 00:00:08,690
(Sheldon:)Obviously, we're no longer
a Justice League.

3
00:00:08,690 --> 00:00:12,920
(Sheldon:)We have no choice but to switch
to our Muppet Baby costumes.

4
00:00:14,430 --> 00:00:16,730
(Raj:)Ooh, I call Kermit.

5
00:00:16,730 --> 00:00:18,760
(Sheldon:)I'm Kermit.
You're Scooter.

6
00:00:18,760 --> 00:00:22,170
(Raj:)Oh, man.
Scooter sucks.

7
00:00:22,170 --> 00:00:25,970
(Raj:)He's the Aquaman
of the Muppet Babies.

8
00:00:27,440 --> 00:00:29,710
(Howard:)No, we can still
make this work.

9
00:00:29,710 --> 00:00:31,280
(Scene:)Leonard,
you talk to Penny.

10
00:00:31,280 --> 00:00:33,280
(Leonard:)What makes you think
I can convince her?

11
00:00:33,280 --> 00:00:35,110
(Howard:)You got her
to have sex with you.

12
00:00:35,110 --> 00:00:38,170
(Howard:)Obviously, your superpower
is brainwashing.

13
00:00:41,000 --> 00:00:44,050
(Leonard:)Okay, let me see
if I understand this.

14
00:00:44,060 --> 00:00:46,290
(Leonard:)You want me
to convince my ex-girlfriend

15
00:00:46,290 --> 00:00:49,060
(Leonard:)to go to a costume party
with her new boyfriend

16
00:00:49,060 --> 00:00:51,130
(Leonard:)just so we can win
a stupid prize?

17
00:00:51,130 --> 00:00:53,900
(Sheldon:)Yes. And make her wear
the black wig. Good luck.

18
00:00:56,470 --> 00:00:57,770
(Penny:)Go away, Sheldon.

19
00:00:57,770 --> 00:00:59,070
(Leonard:)It's Leonard.

20
00:00:59,070 --> 00:01:00,400
(Leonard:)Oh.

